{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S06和S13的感受条目仍然偏密，部分比喻连续堆叠，容易让观众忙于读字而顾不上听音乐；Y的短词并列在局部反而更容易一眼扫过。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用【】突出每段叙事的关键转折，感受文字缩小并按音乐进程适时出现，观众可以先抓住人物正在经历什么，再通过具体的声音、节奏和情绪变化体会其中细节。更重要的是，X把离开后的失落、对亲近的怀念、想回去又害怕重蹈覆辙，直到决定带着想念继续生活，连成了一条清楚的心理因果线；Y虽然也有丰富的感受词，但右侧短词容易形成并列的信息堆积，较难判断哪些是核心、哪些是过渡。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "25e33acb-1a3d-4d03-80ef-95207aa83f3e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T232129382306Z", "elapsed_seconds": 48.5, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:22:17.908289+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0529356083f0f04ce084beb85d580bb19068d1fa252cb08590860966f72c8c14", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_w